            <ArticleTitle>[Cardiotoxicity induced by radiotherapy].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>119-22</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The correct diagnosis of radiation-associated cardiac disease is mandatory to avoid useless surgical treatment. We report one patient who underwent mitral replacement and right coronary revascularization thirteen years after radiant therapy for breast cancer.</AbstractText>
